{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《GoBloop》是一款專為公路旅行設計的行車伴侶工具，讓你在駕駛期間同步記錄距離、時間及預計燃油成本，同時提供多款經典乘車遊戲與速度監測功能，適合家庭或長途車程中想保持娛樂的乘客。這款 App 原價 US $0.99，目前正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>旅途記錄與娛樂</h2>\n<p>App 會即時記錄總距離、行程時間與預計燃油成本，並保存包含地圖視覺化與費用分析的行車歷史。車內乘客可玩 Alphabet Category Game、License Plate Game 等多款經典遊戲，亦可透過速度監測儀表扮演「後座司機」，為整趟公路旅程加入更多互動樂趣。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-397-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-398-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-399-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-400-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-401-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-402-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：GoBloop</li>\n<li>應用類別：Travel</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-12T05:39:54.141487+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":305,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}